  "construction": {
    "basis": "reconstruction",
    "fidelity": "not-applicable",
    "note": "The finished design was read from Brian Wichmann’s CL35 drawing, the centre lines of its bands snapped to exact values. We devised the construction. Every star is two squares on a circle of the same radius: the stars at the corners come first, as in the Dar el Bey crosses, and four more stars sit round O at S, twice that radius from O. Their sides carried on make the notched cross at O. The drawing gives no steps.",
    "changes": "The compass steps, their order and the named points are ours. The comparison with the drawing checks the finished lines, not how the design was first laid out. Wichmann draws the lines as interlaced bands; the tutorial draws their centre lines. No photo of the building was checked.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-26"
  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "Tiling Search, data208/CL35: Dar el Bey, Tunis",
      "creator": "Brian Wichmann",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data208/CL35.html",
      "kind": "drawing",
      "note": "The design was read from his drawing. He takes it from J. Collin, Étude pratique de la décoration polygonale arabe (Paris, 1911), plate 35 (Dar el Bey, Tunis), and lists David Wade’s photo EPC 040. The construction is ours."
    }
  ],
  "given": {"O": "The centre of a cross.", "A": "Halfway from O to the next cross on the horizontal line."},
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Draw a horizontal straight line through O and A. Draw a circle with centre O through A.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through O. The two lines cross the circle at A, B, C and D. Draw a vertical line through each of A and B. Draw a horizontal line through each of C and D. These lines make the square cell, with corners K1, K2, K3 and K4. Draw a straight line through O and K1.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "C": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "B": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "D": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "gx": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gxw": {"line": {"through": "B", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gy": {"line": {"through": "C", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "gys": {"line": {"through": "D", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "K1": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gy"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gy"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gys"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gys"]}},
        "d45": {"line": {"through": ["O", "K1"]}}
      },
      "highlight": ["c", "h"],
      "animate": "ruler",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Draw a vertical line through O. The two lines cross the circle at A, B, C and D. Draw a vertical line through A. Draw a horizontal line through C. They cross at K1, a corner of the cell. Draw a straight line through O and K1."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The circle crosses the line from O to K1 at E. Draw a horizontal line through E. It crosses the vertical line through A at U.",
      "create": {
        "E": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "eh": {"line": {"through": "E", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "U": {"point": {"meet": ["eh", "gx"]}}
      },
      "highlight": ["E", "U"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Draw a line through U at 90° to the line from O to K1. Draw a line through U parallel to the line from O to K1. Turn the two lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "ua": {"line": {"through": "U", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "ud": {"line": {"through": "U", "parallelTo": "d45"}},
        "up": {"repeat": {"of": ["ua", "ud"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["U"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre K1 through U. It crosses the line from O to K1 at R. Draw a vertical line through R. Turn it round O by 90°, three times. The lines make the stars at the corners.",
      "create": {
        "ck": {"circle": {"centre": "K1", "through": "U"}},
        "R": {"point": {"meet": ["ck", "d45"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "rv": {"line": {"through": "R", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "rvp": {"repeat": {"of": ["rv"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["K1", "U", "R"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The lines of step 3 cross the horizontal line through O at G, nearest to O on the right. Draw a circle with centre O through G. It crosses the line from O to K1 at Q. Draw a horizontal line through Q. Turn it round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "G": {"point": {"meet": ["ud", "h"]}},
        "cg": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "G"}},
        "Q": {"point": {"meet": ["cg", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "qh": {"line": {"through": "Q", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "qhp": {"repeat": {"of": ["qh"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["G", "Q"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre G through O. It crosses the horizontal line through O at S. Draw a circle with centre S through G. It crosses the horizontal line through O at T, right of S. It crosses the horizontal line through Q at V, left of S.",
      "create": {
        "cgo": {"circle": {"centre": "G", "through": "O"}},
        "S": {"point": {"meet": ["cgo", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cs": {"circle": {"centre": "S", "through": "G"}},
        "T": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "V": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "qh"], "pick": {"angle": 28.675}}}
      },
      "highlight": ["G", "S", "T", "V"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Draw a line through T at 90° to the line from O to K1. Draw a vertical line through V. Turn the two lines round O by 90°, three times. With the lines through G and Q, they make a star round S.",
      "create": {
        "td": {"line": {"through": "T", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "vv": {"line": {"through": "V", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "tvp": {"repeat": {"of": ["td", "vv"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["T", "V"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "The horizontal line through E crosses a line of step 3 at Z, the first crossing left of U. Draw a line through Z at 90° to the line from O to K1. Turn it round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "Z": {"point": {"meet": ["ud@2", "eh"]}},
        "zd": {"line": {"through": "Z", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "zdp": {"repeat": {"of": ["zd"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["Z"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Join K1, K2, K3 and K4 to mark the tile that repeats.",
      "create": {"tile": {"polygon": ["K1", "K2", "K3", "K4"]}},
      "animate": "fade"
    }
  ],
